{"ID":"20240506100126-iomt3a8","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100126-iomt3a8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100126-iomt3a8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627115603-ue1o0aw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612144325-86txng2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627115603-k4bwgfx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"247伏翼（蝙蝠、夜明砂）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821172032"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627115603-ue1o0aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627115603-ue1o0aw","updated":"20240627115603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"夜明砂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/夜明砂-20240626182756-biumrrt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821172032-s0g41hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821172032-s0g41hf","updated":"20240821172032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 505px;","style":"width: 495px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠-20240821150040-vd2jzic.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 495px;\" parent-style=\"width: 505px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821172032-98ibcga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821172032-98ibcga","updated":"20240821172032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 337px;","style":"width: 327px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠2-20240626183242-s2w5bax.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 327px;\" parent-style=\"width: 337px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 752px;","style":"width: 742px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 1-20240821150153-b84wta8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 742px;\" parent-style=\"width: 752px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821172032-atfi32s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821172032-atfi32s","updated":"20240821172032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 2-20240821150227-i9gy10w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 564px;","style":"width: 554px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 3-20240821150252-hao2inu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 554px;\" parent-style=\"width: 564px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821172032-4zeo97a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821172032-4zeo97a","updated":"20240821172032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 4-20240821150324-q0lotz1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 818px;","style":"width: 808px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠3-20240626183333-n0azbue.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 808px;\" parent-style=\"width: 818px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821172032-2py3hbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821172032-2py3hbd","updated":"20240821172032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠-20240626183000-8z1z5f3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gpwwklk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gpwwklk","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-hv00t15","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-hv00t15","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-t6jfkag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-t6jfkag","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-aocdeb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-aocdeb7","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗，时痛，肠中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。一名鼠沄，一名石肝。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-6qzf1rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-6qzf1rx","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生合浦，十月十二月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-wa3m9p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-wa3m9p6","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案李当之云：即伏翼屎也。李云：天鼠，方言，一名仙鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-41xvxq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-41xvxq0","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案今本方言云：或谓之老鼠，当为天字之误也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-sid2taj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-sid2taj","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上禽，中品二种，旧同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-n3ao2ya","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-n3ao2ya","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-twst50i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-twst50i","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠粪《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-mxmeeh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-mxmeeh1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-kerp3r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-kerp3r1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶白蔹、白薇。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ajffplw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ajffplw","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，寒。入足厥阴经血分。活血消积，散内外结气，疗肝经血分诸病。和朱砂、麝香末，治五疟。猪胆丸，米饮下，治雀盲。掺猪肝，治翳障。酒送末，下死胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-0psvf1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-0psvf1y","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淘净晒干，焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-vtz78fx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-vtz78fx","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-qksjmfu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-qksjmfu","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜明砂《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-y3x2w4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-y3x2w4z","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（即天鼠矢）气味辛寒。（恶白蔹白薇）主治腹中血气。破寒热积聚。治目盲障翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-l59oi8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-l59oi8z","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明目。（屎中淘出细砂。皆所食蚊蚋未化眼也）除惊悸。治疳有效。炒服治瘰。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4ojigpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4ojigpt","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附方青盲不见。夜明砂同糯米炒黄一两。柏叶炙一两。为末。牛胆汁和丸。梧子大。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-usp8n3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-usp8n3j","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每夜精猪和皮〔论〕夜明砂治目盲障翳。固以气类相从。至于疗儿疳。下胎毒。与本经所治腹中血气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gc4mmya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gc4mmya","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入于者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-s3m0pok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-s3m0pok","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修事〕以水淘去灰土恶气。取细砂。晒干焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-fddaj9l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-fddaj9l","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-a93khpo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-a93khpo","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜明砂《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-97x27ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-97x27ke","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名天鼠矢，即蝙蝠屎。性味辛寒，入肝经血分；活血消积，治目盲障翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-fke37j3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-fke37j3","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-rsperxs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-rsperxs","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伏翼《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-9725luv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-9725luv","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」蝙蝠、天鼠、仙鼠、飞鼠、夜燕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ms9tfyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ms9tfyr","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」伏翼：咸、平、无毒。天鼠屎（亦名鼠法、石肝、夜明砂、黑砂星）：辛、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-nysv7zf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-nysv7zf","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-0admmqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-0admmqc","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伏翼："}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-goelxqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-goelxqn","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、上焦发热，白昼贪眠。用五两重的蝙蝠一个（连肠、骨炙燥），云实（炒）五两、威灵仙三两，牵牛（炒）、苋实各二两，丹砂、铅丹各一两，腻粉半两，共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如绿豆大。每服七丸，木通汤送下。此方名“仙乳丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-uqxyng5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-uqxyng5","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、久咳上气，多年服药无效。有蝙蝠除去翅、足，烧焦，研为末，米汤送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xbt52i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xbt52i3","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、久疟不止。用蝙蝠一个（炙）、蛇蜕一条（烧）、蜘蛛一枚（去足、炙）、鳖甲一枚（醋炙）、麝香半钱，共研为末，加炼蜜做成丸子，如麻子大。每服五丸，温酒送下。此方名“伏翼丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-yeqb57f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-yeqb57f","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小儿惊。用入蛰蝙蝠一个，在蝠腹中放入成块朱砂三钱，煅存性，待冷后研为末，分四次空心服下。如儿龄很小，则分五次服，都用开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-jwqoogd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-jwqoogd","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、多年瘰疬。用蝙蝠一个、猫头一个，都撒上黑豆，烧到至骨化，研为末，敷患处。如疮已干，则调油敷涂。内服连翘汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-kcwimcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-kcwimcv","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎："}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-mr5fshn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-mr5fshn","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、内外障翳。用夜明砂末化入猪肝内，煮食并饮汁。有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-cq4ph50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-cq4ph50","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、青盲不见。用夜明砂（糯米砂黄）一两、柏叶（炙）一两，共研为末，加牛胆汁调成丸子，如梧子大。每夜睡觉时，以竹叶汤送服二十丸，至五更时，再用米汤送服二十丸，至病愈为止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4ko2655","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4ko2655","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿夜盲。用夜明砂，炒过，研细，加猪胆汁调成丸子，如绿豆大。每服五丸，米汤送下。又方：用夜明砂、黄芩，等分为末，取淘米水煮猪肝的汁水每次调服半钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-yl3vdy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-yl3vdy5","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、五疟不止。用夜明砂末，每以冷茶送服一钱，立效。又方：治疟发作时，经久不愈。有夜明砂五十粒、朱砂半现金、麝香一钱，共研为末，加糯米饭做成丸子，如小豆大。发病前开水送服十丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ul49yom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ul49yom","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、咳嗽不止。用蝙蝠去翅、足，烧为末。每服一钱，饭后服，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-nlr5o10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-nlr5o10","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、耳出汁用。用夜明砂二钱、麝香二分，共研为末，先将患处揩干净。然后把药末敷上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-2tobcnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-2tobcnz","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、溃肿排脓。用夜明砂一两、桂半两、乳香一分，共研为末，加干砂糖半两，水调匀，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-pklmok8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-pklmok8","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-xkremq6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xkremq6","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-eqlx5bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-eqlx5bk","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸，去面黑。一名鼠法，一名石肝。生合浦山谷，十月十二月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-5hm8n23","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-5hm8n23","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-j4sjtla","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-j4sjtla","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-yg25pmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-yg25pmm","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸，去面黑 。一名鼠法，一名石肝。生合浦山谷。十月、十二月取。（恶白蔹、白薇。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-h3rnrg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-h3rnrg1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶方∶家不复用，俗不识也。唐本注云∶李氏本草云，即伏翼屎也。伏翼条中不用屎，是此明矣。《方∶言》名仙鼠，伏翼条已论也。今注一名夜明砂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-06gvqp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-06gvqp3","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简要济众治五疟方∶夜明砂，捣为散，每服一大钱，用冷茶调下，立瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-w2ka7c3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-w2ka7c3","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-cknxl7s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-cknxl7s","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-p8kkp06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-p8kkp06","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，有毒。主面痈肿，皮肤说说，时痛，腹中益气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸，去面黑生令浦山谷。十月、十二月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xnmh8oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xnmh8oa","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶白蔹、白薇。方家不复用，俗不识也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-dslpj4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-dslpj4e","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《李氏本草》云∶即伏翼屎也，伏翼条中名仙鼠，伏翼条以论也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-qfh1nnr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-qfh1nnr","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-i6th2t5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-i6th2t5","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4dgj2vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4dgj2vd","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛寒，无毒，主治面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-t3jl6jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-t3jl6jl","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（天鼠《本经》名伏翼，列于上品，即蝙蝠也。天鼠屎《日华本草》名夜明砂。天鼠罕用，夜明砂常用，故录之。天鼠冬蛰夏出，昼伏夜飞，多处深山崖穴中及人家旧屋内，食蚊蚋乳石精汁。李时珍曰∶凡采得以水淘去灰土恶气，取细砂晒干焙用，其砂即蚊蚋眼也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-68occt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-68occt1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蝙蝠形极类鼠而飞翔空中，故曰∶天鼠。身有翼而昼伏，故曰伏翼。屎乃蚊蚋乳石之余精，气味辛寒，感阳明太阳金水之化。主治面痈肿者，面属阳明也。皮肤洗洗时痛者，皮肤属太阳也。痈肿则血气不和，阳明行身之前，而治面之痈肿，则腹中血气之病，亦可治也。皮肤洗洗，则身发寒热。皮肤时痛，则寒热积聚，太阳主通体之皮肤，而治皮肤洗洗之时痛，则自发寒热而邪积凝聚者，亦可破也。肝病则惊，心病则悸，除惊悸者，禀阳明金气，而除风木之惊，禀太阳水气，而除火热之悸也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-za6zs2n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-za6zs2n","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144325-h52ze0b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-h52ze0b","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-3hptj9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-3hptj9m","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-wt9os71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-wt9os71","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yè Mínɡ Shā"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gvkphne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gvkphne","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-aa9lnht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-aa9lnht","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蝙蝠屎、天鼠屎、檐老鼠屎"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-d8cubdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-d8cubdo","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-apoqe8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-apoqe8m","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为蝙蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Vespertilio superans Thomas、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大耳蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Plecotus auritus L.或菊头蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"菊头蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Rhinolophus ferrum-equinum Schreber 的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"粪便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可采收，以夏季为宜，去泥土杂质晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-rqw8k5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-rqw8k5e","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ay74f3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ay74f3p","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 焙干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-yruc3py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-yruc3py","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xy0lwly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xy0lwly","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-p42b8u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-p42b8u5","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-0gktlxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-0gktlxo","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-fp0j9vl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-fp0j9vl","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-39gdmv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-39gdmv5","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热明目，活血消积。用于夜盲症，白内障，角膜云翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-0zmslhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-0zmslhd","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-p6fk4cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-p6fk4cn","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-z7m1brg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-z7m1brg","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ob08dry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ob08dry","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夜明砂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为肝经血分药，具有清肝热、散瘀血的功效，在临床上主要用于目疾，尤以治肝热目赤、白睛溢血（即眼球膜下出血）的效果较好，能使瘀血消散；眼目清明。可用本品单味炒微焦，研细，每天一钱，分二次用开水调服；也可配合桑白皮、黄芩、赤芍、丹皮、鲜生地、白茅根等药煎汁服用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-tvb1ghd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-tvb1ghd","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）据文献记载，前人用本品治雀目及内外障翳，常将本品研末，纳入猪肝内，煮食饮汁。此外，本品还可用于疳积及跌扑损伤、瘀血作痛等症，亦取它散血、消积的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ba3xub4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ba3xub4","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-p4ghqfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-p4ghqfo","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-omlp1zd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-omlp1zd","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-kiwqe8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-kiwqe8y","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-57jvktc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-57jvktc","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yè Mínɡ Shā"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-pmldklz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-pmldklz","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-792nexw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-792nexw","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 天鼠屎、鼠法、石肝（《本经》），黑砂星（《纲目》），檐老鼠屎（《江西中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ipkd3lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ipkd3lj","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-mncruej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-mncruej","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《日华子本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-6x3si10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-6x3si10","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-cu81fze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-cu81fze","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蝙蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等多种蝙蝠的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"粪便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年可采，以夏季为宜。到山洞中铲取，除去泥土，拣净杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-1vlyx2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-1vlyx2j","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-tmut0oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-tmut0oh","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国大部分山区均产。主产浙江、江西、江苏、广西、河南、甘肃、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-pzdrcff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-pzdrcff","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-bbepu3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-bbepu3p","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 动物形态详\"蝙蝠\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-199havm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-199havm","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-y8fx9qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-y8fx9qh","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为长椭圆形颗粒，两头微尖，长5～7毫米，直径约2毫米。表面粗糙，棕褐色或灰棕色，破碎者，呈小颗粒或粉末状，在放大镜下观察，可见棕色或黄棕色有光泽的昆虫头、眼及小翅。气无，味微苦而辛。以身干无砂土、色棕褐、质轻、嚼之无砂感、并有小壳点者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-oaa3gf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-oaa3gf1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-48llvjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-48llvjy","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含尿素、尿酸、胆甾醇及少量维生素A等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-guv5ypl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-guv5ypl","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-rarnpkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-rarnpkh","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，簸去泥砂，或漂洗后晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-cnxmihf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-cnxmihf","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目》：凡采得以水淘去灰土恶气，取细砂晒干焙用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-5kq518c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-5kq518c","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-5o3uc4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-5o3uc4b","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-714jcvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-714jcvy","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"厥阴肝经血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-2f35pep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-2f35pep","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入肝、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ar6ovmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ar6ovmu","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-48u0tj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-48u0tj2","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-1k82nv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-1k82nv8","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-2reuqig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-2reuqig","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-5pzfqaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-5pzfqaj","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-9rvtmp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-9rvtmp6","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经集注》：\"恶白蔹、白薇。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-v958qo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-v958qo9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《得配本草》：\"产妇禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-mbui82l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-mbui82l","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-jsf9n47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-jsf9n47","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热明日，散血消积。治青盲雀目，内外障翳，瘰疬，疳积，疟疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ui31hc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ui31hc4","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中气血，破寒热积聚。除惊悸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-nb0n6ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-nb0n6ui","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"去面黑皯。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-86txng2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-86txng2","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"酒服方寸匕，主子死腹中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-9cmfmrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-9cmfmrg","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"炒服治瘰疬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-r4hjxl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-r4hjxl6","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义》：\"合疳药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-scs0r86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-scs0r86","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"治目盲，障翳，明目，除疟。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-jr4xeia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-jr4xeia","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ud3mljp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ud3mljp","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸，散，1～3钱。外用：研末撤或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-kgv7fxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-kgv7fxn","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-yn4hw6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-yn4hw6q","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治青盲：柏叶一两（微炙），夜明砂一两（以糯米炒令黄）。上药，捣罗为末，用牛胆汁拌和，丸如梧桐子大。每夜临卧时，以竹叶汤下二十丸，至五更初，以粥饮下二十丸。（《圣惠方》明目柏叶丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-1oqiqa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-1oqiqa8","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小儿雀目：夜明砂炒研，猪胆汁和丸绿豆大，海米饮下五丸。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-glf4tuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-glf4tuj","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治内外障翳：夜明砂末，化入猪胆内，煮食饮汁。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gpvkjuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gpvkjuu","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治办眼成内障：夜明砂（洗净）、当归、蝉蜕、木贼（去节）各一两。为末，黑羊肝四两，水煎烂，和丸梧子大。食后熟水下五十丸。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xqh3g4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xqh3g4a","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治瘰疬延缠：夜明砂三钱，白蛤壳五钱（火煅）。共研细末，米饭为丸，如绿豆大。每晚服二钱，白汤下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ae0xsja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ae0xsja","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥溃肿排脓：夜明砂一两，桂半两，乳香一分。为末，入干砂糖半两，井水调敷。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-sjh08d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-sjh08d7","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治一切疳毒：夜明砂五钱，入瓦瓶内，以精猪肉三两，薄切，入瓶内，水煮熟，以肉与儿食，饮其汁，取下腹中胎毒；次用生姜四两，和皮切炒，同黄连末一两，糊丸黍米大，米饮服，日三次。（《全幼心鉴》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-6k7l9es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-6k7l9es","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治腹中积聚，寒热：夜明砂三钱，阿魏四钱，花椒五钱，红曲六钱。俱研细末，每服二钱，清晨白汤调下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-opcjsk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-opcjsk1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治疟发作无时，经久不瘥：蝙蝠粪五十粒，朱砂半两，麝香一分。上药，都细研，以软糯米饭和丸，如绿豆大。末发时，以暖水下十丸，（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-3nah7rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-3nah7rj","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治腋下胡臭：夜明砂末，豉汁调。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-jm6o11z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-jm6o11z","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-kuvt2s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-kuvt2s9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"夜明砂及蝙蝠皆厥阴肝经血分药也，能活血消积，故所治目翳盲障，疟疾疳惊，淋带，瘰疬，痈肿，皆厥阴之病也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-fq7mqic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-fq7mqic","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"夜明砂，今人主明目，治目盲障翳。其味辛寒，乃入足厥阴经药，《本经》所主诸证，总属是经所发，取其辛能散内外结滞，寒能除血热气壅故也，然主疗虽多，性有专属，明目之外，余皆可略。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ibxieed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ibxieed","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-rkabuty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-rkabuty","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4xpi54g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4xpi54g","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-42nhny1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-42nhny1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-dckziw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-dckziw9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yè Mínɡ Shā"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-5wvt7ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-5wvt7ev","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-dbdkvur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-dbdkvur","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 天鼠屎、鼠法、石肝、黑砂星、檐老鼠屎"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-c7zfgr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-c7zfgr4","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-pto83bu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-pto83bu","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bat Dung"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gystnre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gystnre","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-u9dt5pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-u9dt5pf","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《日华子本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-hqou2lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-hqou2lg","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-k3ichg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-k3ichg5","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蝙蝠科动物蝙蝠、大管鼻蝠、普通伏翼、大耳蝠、华南大棕蝠、蹄蝠科动物大马蹄蝠及菊头蝠科动物马铁菊头蝠等的粪便。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-j73n7qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-j73n7qm","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Vespertilio superans Thomas2.Murina leucogaster Milne-Edwards3.Pipistrellus abramus Temminck4.Plecotus auritus Linnaeus5.Eptesicus andersoni(Dobson)6.Hipposideros armiger Hodgson7.Phinolophus ferrumequinum Schreber"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-a0zvpr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-a0zvpr8","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采，以夏季为宜。从山洞中铲取，除去泥土，拣去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4vvmmi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4vvmmi1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-y8j80lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-y8j80lo","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.栖息于屋檐、房梁、石缝、岩洞或树洞中。白天休息，黄昏或清晨活动觅食，以双翅目紫虫为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gwdd2d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gwdd2d9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.栖息于屋檐或古老房屋中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-0mlh2i0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-0mlh2i0","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.栖息于山洞、树洞或房屋顶楼内，独居。食昆虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-9p2cbjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-9p2cbjq","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.栖息于山洞、岩洞、树洞中。多为小群栖居。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gn8ra7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gn8ra7b","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.群栖于洞穴或废旧的坑道内。每群上百只甚至数百只。多在洞顶以后足爪钩住缝隙或突出物而作倒持姿势停息。哺乳其母体腹部长出两条皮膜带（育儿带）紧紧捆住幼仔阴谋诡计止滑脱，此为本种动物最特殊的保持适应性特征。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-06g49ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-06g49ss","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.群栖于山洞之中，以昆虫为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-2bj45dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-2bj45dl","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北、华北及甘肃、福建、湖北、湖南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ph3yps9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ph3yps9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于吉林、内蒙古、福建、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gwfowae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gwfowae","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.全国各地均有分布。4.分布于吉林、黑龙江、河北、甘肃、青海、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-dy6ezc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-dy6ezc0","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.分布于河北、山东、浙江、福建、广东、广西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4yzkaw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4yzkaw4","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.分布于长江流域及以南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-uv80dp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-uv80dp9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.分布于吉林、山西、陕西、山西、陕西、山东、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-6zy1xdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-6zy1xdl","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xh1snba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xh1snba","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.蝙蝠，是一种营飞翔生活的小型兽类。较小，体长4.5-8.0cm。眼小，鼻部无鼻叶或其他衍生物。耳短而宽。由指骨末端向上至上膊骨，向后至躯体两侧后肢及尾间，有一层薄的翼膜，其上无毛。尾发达。全身呈黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-rt2lr05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-rt2lr05","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.大管鼻蝠，体形小。鼻孔呈长管状。耳尖钝圆，耳屏尖长呈直形。翼膜宽从趾基起。第5掌骨较第4掌骨稍长。全身毛细长而柔软，毛基深褐色。体背毛灰棕色，并有灰白色细软长毛。翼膜为浅灰褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gmx37xm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gmx37xm","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.普通伏翼，体形小。头骨小而宽。耳小略呈三角形，向前折转可达眼与鼻孔之间。耳屏小而圆钝，内缘凹，外缘突出。足纤小。翼膜从趾基起，距缘膜发达且呈圆弧形。尾最末端伸出股间膜。背面暗棕色，头部色较深。腹面较浅，毛基深棕色而毛端灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-4f86snf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-4f86snf","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.大耳蝠，体长5-8cm。耳极大，为其最着之特征。耳壳近乎卵圆形，前后缘均基突出。耳屏甚长，几为耳长之半。鼻孔朝前上方。后肢及足均纤细。尾与体等长。全身背面浅灰褐色，腹面灰白色，其毛尖灰白色，毛基黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-s1r0xap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-s1r0xap","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.华南棕蝠，体形较大。前臂长5.4-5.7cm。耳较宽，近于三角形。尾端有3节椎骨而突出于股间膜外。背、腹毛基除喉和下腹稍浅而与毛端同色外，余均暗黑褐色。体前表面绝无灰黄色霜斑。下体余部淡黄灰色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xqm2v0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xqm2v0t","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.大马蹄蝠，体形较大，重41-66g，体长9.2-10.5cm。前臂长8.9-9.7cm。有复杂的鼻叶，由4部分组成；最下方为大而宽的马蹄形叶（前叶），前叶两外侧各有4个副小叶；前叶之后为横棍形的鞍状叶；其后顶叶，顶叶显着窄于前叶且分裂成4个小块。耳大，三角形，耳尖尖削，无耳屏。但有一不太突出的前外叶。额部有一很大的腺囊。第2指仅有1节掌骨，第3、第4、第5指有掌骨及2节指骨。第3、第4掌骨等长，第5掌骨短。有距，距约为胫骨长度之半。尾甚长，其长度超过体长之半，股间膜后缘呈钝角向后突出。毛被细而稠密。上体深棕色、棕褐色或褐黑色，毛基褐灰色或灰白色。 下体深棕色或褐棕色，翼膜和股间膜黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-uq1tcoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-uq1tcoy","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.马铁菊头蝠，前臂长5.5-6.0cm，颅2.3-2.5cm。吻部有复杂的叶状突起即鼻叶。鼻叶两侧及下方有一较宽的马蹄形肉叶；其中央有一向前突起的鞍状叶，正面呈提琴状；其侧面中央略凹，后面有一连接叶衬插着，呈宽圆形，与一顶叶相连。耳大略宽阔，耳尖部稍尖，不具耳屏。全身被细密而柔软的毛。背毛淡棕褐色，毛基色淡，呈浅棕灰色，毛尖呈棕色；腹毛为灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-cgabnav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-cgabnav","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-vdolskn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-vdolskn","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，本品为长椭圆形颗粒，两端微尖，长5-7mm，直径约2mm。表面略粗糙，棕褐色或灰棕色；破碎者呈小颗粒状或粉末状。放大镜下观察，可见棕色或黄棕色有光泽的昆虫头、眼及破碎的翅膜。气微或无，味微苦而微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ior70uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ior70uf","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ru5pkge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ru5pkge","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 夜明砂含尿素（urea），尿酸（uric acid），胆甾醇（cholesterol）及少量维生素（vitamin）A等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-5rggfk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-5rggfk0","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-gmtafos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-gmtafos","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，簸去泥砂，或漂洗后晒干。《纲目》：凡采得以水淘去灰上恶气，取细砂晒干焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-o2dbau7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-o2dbau7","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-w9nl4db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-w9nl4db","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-9rgnn6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-9rgnn6u","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-tyd5ozq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-tyd5ozq","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-xvybn64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-xvybn64","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-53veum8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-53veum8","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目疾无瘀滞者及孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-spdisdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-spdisdy","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-fk1pgnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-fk1pgnw","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清肝明目；散瘀消积。主青盲；雀目；目赤肿痛；白晴溢血；内外翳障；小儿疳积；瘰疬；疟疾"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-f43lqo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-f43lqo9","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ow7knsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ow7knsv","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，布包，3-10g；或研末，每次1-3g。外用：适量，研末调涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-g2blam1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-g2blam1","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-jk1675z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-jk1675z","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：夜明砂及蝙蝠皆厥阴肝经血分药也，能活血消积，故所治目翳盲障，疟疾疳惊，淋带，瘰疬，痈肿，皆厥阴之病也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-zldnqbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-zldnqbn","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：夜明砂，今人主明目，治目盲障翳。其味辛寒，乃入足厥阴经药，《本经》所主诸证，总属是经所发，取其辛能散内外结滞，寒能除血热气壅故也。然主疗虽多，性有专属，明目之外，余皆可略。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-r4zsw25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-r4zsw25","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中气血，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-sbf52n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-sbf52n7","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：去面黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-kcl7vqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-kcl7vqa","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《唐本草》：酒服方寸匕，主子死腹中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-7igyaco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-7igyaco","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《日华子本草》：炒股治瘰疬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ko50xjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ko50xjq","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草衍义》：合疳药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-qbdkirp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-qbdkirp","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《纲目》：治目盲，障翳，明目，除疟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-ovbkie0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-ovbkie0","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-1v0c54a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-1v0c54a","updated":"20240612144325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144325-05tg80x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144325-05tg80x","updated":"20240612144325"}},{"ID":"20240612144412-xub1r0w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-xub1r0w","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蝙蝠"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-kt5ep6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-kt5ep6o","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-agiitxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-agiitxr","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Biān Fú"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-fxsysc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-fxsysc0","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-dpz3tqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-dpz3tqd","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 服翼（《尔雅》），天鼠、伏翼（《本经》），飞鼠、老鼠、蟙蟔（《方言》），仙鼠（《尔雅》郭璞注），夜燕（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-uxqtrmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-uxqtrmu","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-y69agk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-y69agk4","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-8wpgdgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-8wpgdgr","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-hjo514h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-hjo514h","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蝙蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。捕得后，去净毛、爪、内脏，风干或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-fdsift4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-fdsift4","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-yc7ujl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-yc7ujl2","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 栖于建筑物的隙缝或树洞中。白昼将身体挂起或伏着停息，晨昏或夜间活动。冬眠。以昆虫（主要是双翅目）为食。分布东北、内蒙古、河北、甘肃、山西、四川、福建、湖南、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-3oxpxwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-3oxpxwk","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-5fh2ens","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-5fh2ens","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 前臂长46～54毫米，颅基长约18毫米。体形较小。耳短而宽，耳屏亦短，其尖端较圆钝。眼极细小。鼻正常。无鼻叶或其他衍生物。前肢特化，指骨延长。由指骨末端向上至膊骨，向后至躯体两侧后肢及尾间，生有一层薄的翼膜；膜上无毛，可见血管分布。胸骨具龙骨突。尾发达，向后延伸至股间膜的后缘。躯体背部毛色呈灰棕色，具有花白细点；腹面浅棕色。雌兽腹部有乳头一对。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-3r35x6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-3r35x6u","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-g35tq3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-g35tq3r","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使（蝙蝠）要重一斤者方采之，每修事，先拭去肉上毛，去爪肠，即留翅并肉脚及嘴，然后用酒浸一宿，漉出，取黄精自然汁涂之，炙令干，方用。每修事重一斤一个，用黄精自然汁五两为度。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-tmztmjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-tmztmjr","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"近世用者，多煅存性耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-wh5zf5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-wh5zf5l","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-j42w3hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-j42w3hf","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》：\"肝经血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-2mdq3ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-2mdq3ix","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-kuy8yul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-kuy8yul","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-bqeqx02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-bqeqx02","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-p7x36j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-p7x36j3","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-g3h87j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-g3h87j5","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"微热，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-949u84r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-949u84r","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-7zi5mmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-7zi5mmw","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：\"苋实、云实为之使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1ecp08h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1ecp08h","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-sqpa2rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-sqpa2rh","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治久咳，疟疾，淋病，惊风，目翳，瘰疬，金疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ncwahlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ncwahlm","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主目瞑，明目，夜视有睛光。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ab4ov0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ab4ov0q","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②李当之《药录》：\"主女子生子余疾，带下病，无子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-us8ia3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-us8ia3h","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"（目）痒痛，疗淋，利水道。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-dktfnd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-dktfnd7","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"治久咳上气，久疟，瘰疬，金疮内漏，小儿鬾病，惊风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1ckaj48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1ckaj48","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草新编》：\"拨翳膜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-hybpeq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-hybpeq8","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草求原》：\"治病，干血气痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-23e3n3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-23e3n3h","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-fislctd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-fislctd","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散。外用：矾末掺或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-fdsz4f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-fdsz4f9","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-s55t0zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-s55t0zn","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治久咳嗽上气，十年、二十年：蝙蝠除翅、足，烧令燋，末，饮服之。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-xz8rn26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-xz8rn26","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治久疟不止：蝙蝠七个，去头、翅、足，捣千下，丸梧子大。每服一丸，清汤下，鸡鸣时一丸，禺中（日近午）一丸。（《范汪方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-dbdresx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-dbdresx","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿惊痫：入蛰蝙蝠一个，入成块朱砂三钱在腹内，以新瓦合煅存性，候冷为末，空心分四服，儿小分五服，白汤下。（《医学集成》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-jds2ym5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-jds2ym5","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿慢惊风及天瘹夜啼：蝙蝠一枚（去翼、脂、肚，炙令焦黄），人中白一分（细研），干蝎一分（微炒），麝香一钱（细研）。上药，捣细罗为散，入人中白等同研令匀，炼蜜为丸，如绿豆犬，每服以乳汁研下三丸，量儿大小，加减服之。（《圣惠方》返魂丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-v3rfcuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-v3rfcuk","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治瘰疬多年不瘥：蝙蝠一个，猫头一个。上同烧作灰：撒上黑豆，煅其灰骨化，碎为细末，湿即干掺，干则油调敷。（《奇效良方》蝙蝠散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-fd5vuc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-fd5vuc3","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治金疮（出）血肉瘘（肉瘘，《纲目》引作\"内漏\"）：蝙蝠三枚，烧令烟尽沫下，绢筛之。上以水服方寸匕，一日服令尽，当下如水，血消化也。（《刘涓子鬼遗方》蝙蝠消血散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-3z4r8kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-3z4r8kr","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-yhvjfpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-yhvjfpt","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗慢性气管炎:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用复方蝙蝠丸观察222例，有效率为89.6％，显效率达36.9％。单纯型与喘息型疗效无明显差异。大多数病例在服药1～4天内出现疗效。少数病例服药后出现头晕、恶心、口子、上腹不适等副作用。可自行消失。制剂及用法：取新鲜蝙蝠剥皮、去胃肠，置瓦上焙干（勿焦）研粉；另用一点红5钱，鼠曲草1两（均为干品），水煎两次，滤液合并浓缩成1：1浓度，然后加入蝙蝠粉6钱，以炼蜜拌匀，调制成丸。为1日量，早晚分服，10天为一疗程。亦有用活蝙蝠1只，和适量食糖，置锅内隔水蒸取药液，每日2次分服；或用死蝙蝠置瓦上焙焦研末，再加等量葡萄糖粉拌匀压片，每片0.5克，每日12片（相当于1只蝙蝠），2次分服。共治15例，服药7天后明显好转4例，好转4例，无效7例。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-f44l01u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-f44l01u","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-k9tm3my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-k9tm3my","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蝙蝠种类很多，除上述外，常见的尚有家蝙蝠；大耳蝠；大菊头蝠等亦同等供药用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-7o0zeag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-7o0zeag","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-c95v5dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-c95v5dm","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ew3w0px","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ew3w0px","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蝙蝠"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-434okxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-434okxf","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-nrc42ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-nrc42ne","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Biān Fú"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-379i55w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-379i55w","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-pktja9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-pktja9a","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 服翼、天鼠、伏翼、飞鼠、老鼠、仙鼠、夜燕、盐老鼠"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-j4uwukh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-j4uwukh","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-9kresjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-9kresjo","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bat"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-lm1uus7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-lm1uus7","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-sgk1hj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-sgk1hj0","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》；1.《唐本草》：伏翼，以其昼伏有翼尔。《李氏本草》云，即天鼠也。又云：西平山中别有天鼠，十一月、十二月取。其脑主女子面疱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-jljbi00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-jljbi00","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：编幅性能泻人，观治金疮方，皆致下利，其毒可知。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-3u909uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-3u909uc","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-xx65932","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-xx65932","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蝙蝠科动物蝙蝠、大管鼻蝠、普通伏翼、大耳蝠、华南棕蝠和蹄蝠科动物大刀蹄蝠及菊头蝠科动物马铁菊头蝠等的干燥全体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-bfunp68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-bfunp68","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Vespertilio superans Thomas2.Murina leucogaster Milne-Edwards3.Pipistrellus abramus Temminck4.Plecotus auritus Linnaeus5.Eptesicus andersoni(Dobson)6.Hipposideros armiger Hodgson7.Phinolophus ferrumequinum Schreber"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-51cpr7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-51cpr7o","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：捕杀后，去净毛、爪、内脏，风干或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ubj2m9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ubj2m9v","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-12lvovh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-12lvovh","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.栖息于屋檐、房梁、石缝、岩洞或树洞中。白天休息，黄昏或清晨活动觅食，以双翅目紫虫为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-tr86k84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-tr86k84","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.栖息于屋檐或古老房屋中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-gvvprx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-gvvprx2","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.栖息于山洞、树洞或房屋顶楼内，独居。食昆虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-vshgzg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-vshgzg3","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.栖息于山洞、岩洞、树洞中。多为小群栖居。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-bkd7d79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-bkd7d79","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.群栖于洞穴或废旧的坑道内。每群上百只甚至数百只。多在洞顶以后足爪钩住缝隙或突出物而作倒持姿势停息。哺乳其母体腹部长出两条皮膜带（育儿带）紧紧捆住幼仔阴谋诡计止滑脱，此为本种动物最特殊的保持适应性特征。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-5qthlmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-5qthlmy","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.群栖于山洞之中，以昆虫为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-y4saqaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-y4saqaa","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北、华北及甘肃、福建、湖北、湖南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-jhhjtwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-jhhjtwi","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于吉林、内蒙古、福建、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-tphfmrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-tphfmrk","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.全国各地均有分布。4.分布于吉林、黑龙江、河北、甘肃、青海、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-jjwwqsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-jjwwqsw","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.分布于河北、山东、浙江、福建、广东、广西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-4v5er6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-4v5er6g","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.分布于长江流域及以南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1ino2on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1ino2on","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.分布于吉林、山西、陕西、山西、陕西、山东、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-401odmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-401odmm","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-5s0n9jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-5s0n9jz","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.蝙蝠，是一种营飞翔生活的小型兽类。较小，体长4.5-8.0cm。眼小，鼻部无鼻叶或其他衍生物。耳短而宽。由指骨末端向上至上膊骨，向后至躯体两侧后肢及尾间，有一层薄的翼膜，其上无毛。尾发达。全身呈黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-42vhq0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-42vhq0y","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.大管鼻蝠，体形小。鼻孔呈长管状。耳尖钝圆，耳屏尖长呈直形。翼膜宽从趾基起。第5掌骨较第4掌骨稍长。全身毛细长而柔软，毛基深褐色。体背毛灰棕色，并有灰白色细软长毛。翼膜为浅灰褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-hiuc2qd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-hiuc2qd","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.普通伏翼，体形小。头骨小而宽。耳小略呈三角形，向前折转可达眼与鼻孔之间。耳屏小而圆钝，内缘凹，外缘突出。足纤小。翼膜从趾基起，距缘膜发达且呈圆弧形。尾最末端伸出股间膜。背面暗棕色，头部色较深。腹面较浅，毛基深棕色而毛端灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-u0p3wbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-u0p3wbf","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.大耳蝠，体长5-8cm。耳极大，为其最着之特征。耳壳近乎卵圆形，前后缘均基突出。耳屏甚长，几为耳长之半。鼻孔朝前上方。后肢及足均纤细。尾与体等长。全身背面浅灰褐色，腹面灰白色，其毛尖灰白色，毛基黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-s9ugnzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-s9ugnzk","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.华南棕蝠，体形较大。前臂长5.4-5.7cm。耳较宽，近于三角形。尾端有3节椎骨而突出于股间膜外。背、腹毛基除喉和下腹稍浅而与毛端同色外，余均暗黑褐色。体前表面绝无灰黄色霜斑。下体余部淡黄灰色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-6qq7qoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-6qq7qoo","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.大马蹄蝠，体形较大，重41-66g，体长9.2-10.5cm。前臂长8.9-9.7cm。有复杂的鼻叶，由4部分组成；最下方为大而宽的马蹄形叶（前叶），前叶两外侧各有4个副小叶；前叶之后为横棍形的鞍状叶；其后顶叶，顶叶显着窄于前叶且分裂成4个小块。耳大，三角形，耳尖尖削，无耳屏。但有一不太突出的前外叶。额部有一很大的腺囊。第2指仅有1节掌骨，第3、第4、第5指有掌骨及2节指骨。第3、第4掌骨等长，第5掌骨短。有距，距约为胫骨长度之半。尾甚长，其长度超过体长之半，股间膜后缘呈钝角向后突出。毛被细而稠密。上体深棕色、棕褐色或褐黑色，毛基褐灰色或灰白色。 下体深棕色或褐棕色，翼膜和股间膜黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-a9edn78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-a9edn78","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.马铁菊头蝠，前臂长5.5-6.0cm，颅2.3-2.5cm。吻部有复杂的叶状突起即鼻叶。鼻叶两侧及下方有一较宽的马蹄形肉叶；其中央有一向前突起的鞍状叶，正面呈提琴状；其侧面中央略凹，后面有一连接叶衬插着，呈宽圆形，与一顶叶相连。耳大略宽阔，耳尖部稍尖，不具耳屏。全身被细密而柔软的毛。背毛淡棕褐色，毛基色淡，呈浅棕灰色，毛尖呈棕色；腹毛为灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ttvje7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ttvje7g","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-gypeldc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-gypeldc","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蝙幅种类很多，除上述外，常见的尚有家蝙蝠Pipistrel-lusabramus（Temminck）；大耳蝠Plecotusauritus(L.）；大菊头蝠Rhinolophus ferrum-equinum schreber等亦同等供药用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ul7weyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ul7weyd","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-2bbwmgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-2bbwmgn","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使（蝙蝠）要重一斤者方采之，每修事，先拭去肉上毛，去爪肠，即留翅井肉脚及嘴，然后用酒浸一宿，漉出，取黄精自然汁涂之，炙令干，方用。每修事重一斤一个，用黄精自然汁五两为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-v3knn0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-v3knn0w","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：近世用者，多煅存性耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-0nz0ye1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-0nz0ye1","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-vzw8j9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-vzw8j9i","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1v8kc8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1v8kc8s","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-uddfeax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-uddfeax","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-zns8uod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-zns8uod","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-81y4myr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-81y4myr","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草求原》：“性悍，服之多下利。金疮出血不止成内漏者，泻水而血消，其毒可知，勿轻用。”"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1841bgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1841bgh","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-mbrcpo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-mbrcpo3","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 止咳平喘；利水通淋；平肝明目；解毒。主咳嗽；喘息；淋证；带下目昏；目翳；瘰疬"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-iupas4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-iupas4i","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1uibhnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1uibhnr","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散，1-3g。外用：适量，研末撒，或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-1dt7jyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-1dt7jyo","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-zoy0nzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-zoy0nzp","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治久咳嗽上气，十年、二十年：蝙蝠除翅、足。烧灰，未，饮服之。(《时后方》)②治久疟不止：蝙蝠七个，去头、翅、足，捣千下，丸梧子大。每服一丸，清汤下，鸡鸣时一丸，禺中(日近午)一丸。(《范汪方》)③治小儿惊痫：人蛰蝙蝠一个，人成块朱吵三钱在腹内，以新瓦合煅存性，候冷为未；空心分四服，儿小分五服，白汤下，(《医学集成》)④治小儿慢惊风及夜啼：蝙蝠一枚(去翼、脂、肚，炙令焦黄)，人中白一分(细研)，干蝎一分(微炒)，麝香一钱(细研)。上药，捣细罗为散，入人中白等同研令匀，炼蜜为丸，如绿豆大，每服以乳汁研下三丸，量儿大小，加减服之。(《圣惠方》返魂丹)⑤治瘰疬多年不痉：蝙蝠一个，猫头一个。上同烧作灰，撒上黑豆，煅其灰骨化，碎为细未，湿即干掺，干则油调敷。(《奇效良方》蝙蝠散)⑥治金疮(出)血肉瘘(肉瘘，《纲目》引作内漏)：蝙蝠三枚，烧令烟尽沫下，绢筛之。上以水服方寸匕，一日服令尽，当下如水，血消化也。(《刘涓子鬼遗方》蝙蝠消血散)"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-ecf1bdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-ecf1bdh","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-5ugckt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-5ugckt7","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗慢性气管炎：用复方蝙蝠丸观察222例，有效率为89.6%，显效率达36.9%。单纯型与喘息型疗效无明显差异。大多数病例在眼药1-4天内出现疗效。少数病例服药后出现头晕、恶心、口干、上腹不适等副作用，可自行消失。制剂及用法：取新鲜蝙蝠剥皮、去胃肠，置瓦上焙干（勿焦）研粉；另用一点红（Emiliasonchifolia(L.)DC.]5钱，鼠曲草（CnaphaliumaffineD. Don)1两（均为干品），水煎两次，滤液合并浓缩成1：1浓度，然后加入蝙蝠粉6钱，以炼蜜拌匀，调制成九。为1日量，早晚分服，10天为一疗程。亦有用活蝙蝠1只，和适量食糖，置锅内隔水蒸取药液，每日之次分服；或用死蝙蝠置瓦上焙焦研未，再加等量葡萄糖粉拌匀压片，每片0.5克，每日12片（相当于1只蝙蝠），2次分服。共治15例，服药7天后明显好转例，好转4 例，无效7例。"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-qmy5mip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-qmy5mip","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612144412-oguivhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144412-oguivhe","updated":"20240612144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612144414-f26d3j7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612144414-f26d3j7"}},{"ID":"20240612144415-5yn6tvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612144415-5yn6tvc"}}]}